<title>CHINA: DEUTSCHE BANK SETS WARRANTS ON PROPERTY BASKET.</title>
<headline>DEUTSCHE BANK SETS WARRANTS ON PROPERTY BASKET.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Monday it launched three billion American-style call warrants on a basket of two property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket is composed of the following:</p>
<p> Concord Land Development Co Ltd    0.023 shares</p>
<p> New World Development Co Ltd	 0.007 shares</p>
<p> Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$0.648     PREMIUM	 22.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.0185    GEARING	 3.7x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  11.JUN.98    LISTING DATE  28.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 26.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$0.682     MIN EXER LOT  200,000</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>			 ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
